    "updated_at": "2026-11-26T23:44:57Z",
    "body": "fix on issue/4095-heidenhain-dialect-resolver · PR #4248 · pinned by post::heidenhain_dialect::tests (13), heidenhain_cycles::levels, heidenhain_cycles::presets, heidenhain_block_form, script_heidenhain_klartext::dialect_tests · merges at the next cut\n\nPR #4248 is the first slice. It ends with `Refs #4095`, so this issue stays open. The PR is stacked on #4242.\n\nThe slice adds:\n- One resolver in the post crate. It maps `controller.identity` to a profile and capability flags. The scripts read it as `machine.heidenhainDialect`.\n- The DIN/ISO post reads `languageIso`, `drillC200` (this replaces the #4172 table) and `cycle247`.\n- The Klartext post reads `m140`, `cycle247`, `m136m137` and `decimals`.\n- No golden file changes. The Picomax 55 (iTNC 530, NC 340490-03) output does not change.\n\nLeft for later slices:\n- Klartext: serve other iTNC 530 releases. The manual quill procedure is verified for NC 340490-03 only (#4114).\n- Klartext: `TOOL CALL \"NAME\"` (`toolCallByName`, `toolNameMax`), the dwell form, drilling cycles with `drill.c205`, and an M91/M92 retract where `m140` is no.\n- Flags that no post writes yet: `oldCycles`, `tilt`, `tcpm.kt`/`tcpm.iso`, `planeAxial`, `planeSym`, `feedFzFu`, `arcs.*`, `q.*`, `programName`, `tolerance`.\n- Option gating from `installed_options`. The options are parsed now, but no flag reads them.\n- `m136m137` on TNC 320/620/640 and TNC7. The research does not settle this.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
